{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Prior to occupation, details of all proposed boundary\r\ntreatments, with particular reference those required around the proposed areas\r\non defensible space approved under drawing 256/PLN/308 Rev A , indicating their positions, design, materials and height,\r\nshall be submitted to, and approved in writing by, the local planning authority. The development shall be completed in accordance with the approved details and\r\nshall thereafter be retained as such.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The\r\ndevelopment to which this permission relates must be begun before the\r\nexpiration of two years from the date of this final reserved matter.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to\r\noccupation, details of the provision of green/biodiverse roofs within the\r\ndevelopment shall been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning\r\nAuthority. The details to be submitted shall comprise:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;a)\r\nfull identification of the roof areas to be used for the provision of\r\ngreen/biodiverse roofs;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b)\r\ndetails of the planting and substrate to be used, including roof build up,\r\nplant species/mix(es) schedule; and&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;c)\r\ndetails of the maintenance including irrigation.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe development shall be carried out in\r\naccordance with the details so agreed and shall be retained and maintained as\r\nsuch thereafter.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The\r\ndevelopment hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the\r\nfollowing approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Covering\r\nLetter by Shanly Homes (dated 11.04.24)256/PLN/300 – Site Location Plan; 1256/PLN/301\r\n– Existing and Proposed Floor Plans; 256/PLN/308 Rev A – Proposed Landscaping Plan\r\n(received 06.06.24)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;All\r\nplans received &lt;span style=&quot;background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot;&gt;11.04.2024, unless\r\notherwise stated&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot; face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to the commencement of the development hereby permitted, full detail of the disposal of surface water&amp;nbsp;by means of a sustainable drainage system (SuDs), and other associated features, shall be be submitted to, and approved in writing by, the local planning authority. The works shall thereafter be implemented and retained in accordance with the details thereby approved.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to occupation and notwithstanding the\r\napproved indicative plan, &lt;span style=&quot;background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot;&gt;a full scheme\r\nof hard and soft landscape works shall be submitted to, and approved in writing\r\nby, the local planning authority&lt;/span&gt; for the site. These shall include\r\nplanting plans; schedules of plants, noting species, plant sizes and proposed\r\nnumbers / densities; and details of all proposed hard landscaping surfaces, such\r\nas manufacturer’s specification&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The development shall be fully implemented out\r\nin accordance with the details thereby agreed&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
